{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "31ed09ff834ff3f8aecd57a12612d59ca2f26adac2c8993d33651d877f4d6f29", "ja": "スカウトのために街に来てみたものの、「キミだ！」\nっていう子は、なかなか見つからないものだな。", "zh": "虽说我是为了发掘偶像而上街的，\n但很难找到那种让人觉得「就是你了！」的人选呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_1001_p", "source_sha256": "40a657dc4d8fd928a21b8481fd120267037e521602d2004306c73f3586748e67", "ja": "どこかにいないかな……かわいくて魅力的で、誰もが\n心を奪われる！　そんなスーパーアイドルの卵！！", "zh": "「既可爱又有魅力，可以夺走所有人的心！」\n……这种超级偶像潜力股会不会就在街上的某处呢！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ea69d325f0667b81de2ec162464cee3194694e680defbeef29d2a4d7ccc1584e", "ja": "……なんて。\nそんな夢みたいな話、あるはずが……。", "zh": "……想太多了，\n这种作梦般的情节，当然不可能……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "3a591741862a5cddb0d94def15c9d34ed03e6c60268ebfba4e90acc0b5f56432", "ja": "ヘイヘイヘイヘイ！\nそこのカレシー！！", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿嘿！\n那边的男子！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
