{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e1d825864acb2300c0f937c5827cd59ff49c1297974d53460879691abbce3e42", "ja": "ん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "5b2f9c9ec5d7fd89c99e7bcc657bb870f8406fa8be2d83c8c46148d3eeed89ac", "ja": "事情はわかった！\n今なら特別に、この茜ちゃんが相談に乗ったげるよ♪", "zh": "明白你的情况了！\n现在的话本人小茜可以特别陪你商量喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c28643a1f0c18606f2bcfdd9d40b5eea323429dfc2a9a8907247674b8a3c19d5", "ja": "なんだか、ナンパみたいな声の掛け方だけど……\n君は？", "zh": "这搭话方式好像在搭讪一样……\n你是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "7f6f5007aba9ef1881ad869b642f29df437f07deaf88decbbc8f4844206b1ebe", "ja": "通りすがりのエンジェルだよ！　天下の往来で\nブツブツつぶやく危ないキミを、助けに舞い降りた！", "zh": "是路过的天使喔！\n特地下凡解救在大马路上碎碎念、身陷危险之中的你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "f16f2dbe99f11bd2b14df510338e13315a3105e87c5c5656aa2b60383a34cd76", "ja": "ま～、冗談はさておき……お仕事お疲れさま！\n話は聞いたから、そのお願い叶えてあげるね！", "zh": "好了～玩笑话就先说到这……工作辛苦了！\n小茜听到你说的话了，所以会实现你的愿望喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_1010_p", "source_sha256": "de1f1afbd641d4fd8a70a4f717001355ba0eec10db826d88872f98dd964b2aaa", "ja": "話を聞いてたって、アイドルのスカウトのことか？\n叶えるって、どうやって……。", "zh": "你说听到我说的话，是指发掘偶像吗？\n你要用什么方式实现……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "c5143158b517ed1cf442fa625d03e031ccca7d4a89269419cd1dffeb7b04a0d1", "ja": "もー、鈍いなぁー！\nこのカワイイカワイイ茜ちゃんを見ても、気づかない？", "zh": "真是的──好迟钝啊──！\n你看着小茜可爱到不行的模样，还没有察觉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "0ba12ec01076dd8eef17efe891533c4d18928d1de9ec02419a2b6d84efc35c11", "ja": "ズバリ！　茜ちゃんがアイドルになってあげよー！\nというコトだよ！", "zh": "意思就是！小茜愿意当偶像──！\n就是这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "0ad52a4c1dffa3574aa828ce79051ac2fe239adc3811d9097c84426823562c84", "ja": "そんで、事務所はドコ？　いつからお仕事開始？\n茜ちゃん、いつでもいいよー♪", "zh": "所以，事务所在哪？何时开始工作？\n小茜随时都能奉陪──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_1014_p", "source_sha256": "d139acac82e50e54975a6d4611ec82e84dd2b848c58e1891996badb3f0bdc0bb", "ja": "（よくわからないが、なんだか大物の予感がするぞ。\nとりあえず、名刺だけでも渡してみるか）", "zh": "（虽然有点摸不着头绪，但我有预感她大有可为。\n总之先给她名片看看吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_1015", "source_sha256": "b17ca4d3bdeeeaffbc5d36b1c3d7e7fd69390b707c28e7d3c021eca0bf941d3d", "ja": "名刺を渡す", "zh": "递出名片", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "f5e9b185fd76058c873a1d63fe660be6a5f851ea4204a4720abf9839e506953e", "ja": "ええと、うちは765プロっていうんだけど……。", "zh": "呃，我们公司叫765艺能……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_2001_023aka", "source_sha256": "f7f908e2d17a3207a37c196da3c94c23aa162f44ba4817049cbdc0dc2a763a4b", "ja": "765プロ！？　39プロジェクトの！？\nなんと、本物のアイドルスカウトだったとは……。", "zh": "765艺能！？39PROJECT那个！？\n没想到居然是真的在发掘偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_2002_p", "source_sha256": "4c692176b10be766facb715bcd09587fbc9e15c8a75396054a8741906724ae7f", "ja": "へえ、39プロジェクトを知ってるんだ？", "zh": "哦，你知道39PROJECT啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_2003_023aka", "source_sha256": "286f208543e92c56fe4a0115e6478673e7a7d0c661a1ed24fb11af1066eefd53", "ja": "フッ、まあね！\nSレア名刺、ゲット！　ニャハッ☆", "zh": "哼，算是吧！\n获得SR名片了！喵哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_2004_023aka", "source_sha256": "e33063929aa7d85e0efba41653a74e13ebe72e2b80e1f8ebe3186384046098a9", "ja": "現実の方がゲームよりやさしいな～。それじゃ、\n次はオーディションで！　行けたら行くから！", "zh": "现实还比游戏容易呢～那么，\n下次就在甄选时见！要是能去小茜就会去的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_2005_p", "source_sha256": "1a8d54f4c1ac9fa18dc85e5324f2dc3c7fc2ba2a20bde26ca94a49cf595540c3", "ja": "えっ？　あっ、ちょっと……！", "zh": "咦？啊，等一下……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_2006_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_2007_p", "source_sha256": "1536bc8ef941792180cbb1188e74331a49ea93e5701b4c6a58b5ddc9b021ac48", "ja": "（オーディションが始まったが、あの子は来ない。\nそれ以前に名刺を渡したのに、今日まで連絡もない）", "zh": "（虽然甄选已经开始了，但她还没来。\n而且虽然给了她名片，但到今天都没接到联络。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_2008_p", "source_sha256": "3e32561d6a0d8c633f5b955a5d317e825efb9d416e3912a30f36bc498fe2047e", "ja": "今になって思い返すと、顔も声も結構可愛かったし……\nもしかして、本当にダイヤの原石だったんじゃ……？", "zh": "现在回想起来，她的脸跟声音都满可爱的……\n该不会她真的是颗钻石原石……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_2009_023aka", "source_sha256": "809a4cd8e4a752e088b3f1f837650158c1a739ab69f4d038f2de5a95405e6a35", "ja": "じゃじゃーん！　野々原茜ちゃん華麗に参上！\nちょっぴり遅れちゃったけど、許してくれるよね？", "zh": "锵锵──！野野原茜华丽登场！\n虽然小小迟到了，但你会原谅小茜的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_2010_p", "source_sha256": "fe9825771ca7e34603e30efd653e1e556499fcf23306a428cdbb1a9163bb7bc2", "ja": "あっ、君はあの時の、通りすがりのエンジェル……！\nよかった、来てくれたんだな！", "zh": "啊，你是那时路过的天使……！\n太好了，你来啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_2011_023aka", "source_sha256": "2c7f8441ba5231a5e581c2dbcf030ea77b807153baccdb1dfff9ac6127bd5be9", "ja": "あれっ？　もしかして茜ちゃんのコト待ってた？\nアイドルになってあげるって言ったし、二言はないよ！", "zh": "咦？你该不会等小茜等得很担心？\n小茜说过愿意当偶像，不会反悔的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_2012_023aka", "source_sha256": "bbd3d74c752cf0740737cc6894ce6dfcb3c008968845fa3720d4d003e707b17d", "ja": "自己アピールいくよー！　野々原茜、16歳！\n褒められて伸びるタイプでーす♪", "zh": "那要开始自我推荐啰──！野野原茜，16岁！\n是被称赞就会表现得很好的类型──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_2013_023aka", "source_sha256": "dcd6bd8aca69f9b508117de1647698088206c2126ec90f6fddd2866956d6726f", "ja": "インラインスケートで踊りたいけど、あえてセーブ！\nとりあえず、茜ちゃんのダンスを見せてあげよー！！", "zh": "虽然很想穿直排轮跳舞，但刻意先藏一手！\n总之先让你看看小茜跳的舞吧──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_2014_p", "source_sha256": "5137933d7a20e2347e91da173aee55639beb8e57a867136ca047c8642dc3dc0b", "ja": "す、すごい！\n難易度の高い技を軽々と……！", "zh": "好、好厉害！\n那么轻松地做出高难度技巧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_2015_023aka", "source_sha256": "2ca51b8cde035696fa8027c87880107388aeb3332851ef679b7265bc2ea614c9", "ja": "ま、ざっとこんなもんよ♪\n本気の半分の半分の1.5倍くらいかな～？　ニャハ。", "zh": "嗯，大概就是这样♪\n这算是小茜认真时的一半的一半的1.5倍吧～？喵哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_2016", "source_sha256": "0002d60cbf1e13f496094605e4ab64664853a7f2ec03722e7b23c4d866b673d9", "ja": "キミだ！", "zh": "就是你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
