{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_3001_023aka", "source_sha256": "1ed1624b336a2927ced510a9234fa5b4ed595b78f264cf75abfd2333780e1696", "ja": "まさかの即断即決！　さすが、茜ちゃんの\n選んだ{$P$}ちゃんだね！", "zh": "居然马上就决定了！真不愧是小茜\n看上的小{$P$}呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_3002_p", "source_sha256": "981096799c955963e09c106d3c398eae966cb2a1ac23b1ba57893fabec02174e", "ja": "{$P$}P……ちゃん？", "zh": "小……{$P$}P？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_3003_023aka", "source_sha256": "abfb01f80ec8f26cc9a7a59d44896e1ae78bbdea2b87e906d945142e9a84608e", "ja": "まあまあ、細かいことは気にしない！\nこれからよろしくね、{$P$}ちゃん！", "zh": "哎呀哎呀，别在意小细节！\n今后请多指教喔，小{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_001_3004_p", "source_sha256": "1bf6d042d2287ad962d903eda7c91eed58765901f40026994cf10fd905b504d9", "ja": "（かなり個性的だけど、面白い子だな。\nどんなアイドルに成長するか、楽しみだ……！）", "zh": "（虽然她个性很特别，但是个有趣的孩子呢。\n真期待她会成长为怎么样的偶像……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
